  "title": "Altria Declares Regular Quarterly Dividend of $1.06 Per Share",
  "summary": "Altria Group, Inc. (NYSE: MO) today announced that our Board of Directors declared a regular quarterly dividend of $1.06 per share, payable on April 30, 2026 to shareholders of record as of March 25, 2026. The ex-dividend date is March 25, 2026. Altria Client Services Investor Relations 804-484-8222 Altria Client Services Media Relations 804-484-8897 www.altria.com/contact-us/media Source: Altria Group, Inc.",
